{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #13233e; box-sizing: border-box; color: #e4eff7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #e4eff7; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #e4eff7; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 24px 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e推开极夜之窗，一抹蓝绿极光在深邃夜空中缓缓流转，把长文阅读带进沉浸静谧的星空场域。\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 36px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #a5e8ca; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 14px; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e会呼吸的极夜流光背景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #e4eff7; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e深海靛蓝底面配柔和流转极光 GIF，不刺眼、不晃动，只为文字添一层空灵光感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #a5e8ca; color: #e4eff7; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px 12px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e有些仰望星空的念头，要在足够深的夜色里才看得清楚。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/starry-night.jpg\" alt=\"繁星夜空与静谧湖面剪影\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 36px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #a5e8ca; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 14px; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e极光模板的沉浸体验\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e深蓝绿极光色盘区别于紫黑赛博与纯黑\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e柔和象牙白正文保障暗底长读清晰度\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e适合夜读专栏、科幻科普与年度畅想\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #b2c4dc; color: #e4eff7; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e抬头看一眼远方的光，明天继续轻装出发。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
